{"id":"torrey:fox-the","source":"torrey","name":"Fox, The","slug":"fox-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Found in deserts — Eze 13:4.","refs":[["Ezek",13,4,13,4]]},{"text":"Abounded in Palestine — Jdj 15:4; La 5:18.","refs":[["Judg",15,4,15,4],["Lam",5,18,5,18]]},{"text":"Active. — Ne 4:3.","refs":[["Neh",4,3,4,3]]},{"text":"Crafty. — Lu 13:32.","refs":[["Luke",13,32,13,32]]},{"text":"Carnivorous. — Ps 63:10.","refs":[["Ps",63,10,63,10]]},{"text":"Destructive to vines — Song 2:15.","refs":[["Song",2,15,2,15]]},{"text":"Dwells in holes — Mt 8:20; Lu 9:58.","refs":[["Matt",8,20,8,20],["Luke",9,58,9,58]]},{"text":"False prophets. — Eze 13:4.","refs":[["Ezek",13,4,13,4]]},{"text":"Cunning and deceitful persons. — Lu 13:32.","refs":[["Luke",13,32,13,32]]},{"text":"Enemies of the church. — Song 2:15.","refs":[["Song",2,15,2,15]]},{"text":"Used by Samson for annoying the Philistines. — Jdj 15:4-6.","refs":[["Judg",15,4,15,6]]}],"refCount":13}
